{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-27T13:44:23.397Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"897c90c1b80c3e3bf21a36a6","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-ado-sdk-history-fence"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Expose a monotonic history fence for native conditional SDK updates"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The new preview/CAS rule requires an under-lock monotonically growing witness. SDK 2026.10.24 BulkItemUpdateMutation exposes only match: BulkItemUniqueKey (key/value), with no expectedHistoryHead or expectedHistoryLength precondition on native lifecycle updates. A real non-git SDK probe freezes Date to the inspected updated_at, performs title Initial -> Foreign -> Initial, then commits an update matched to the old timestamp: history grows 1 -> 4, timestamp stays equal, conflict is false and stale Planned wins. This is an SDK timestamp-match limitation, not a field-presence regression. Searched public SDK declarations for transaction, match, history and preconditions, and open upstream issue searches history head precondition and ABA match returned zero. Desired API: BulkItemUpdateMutation.expectedHistoryHead or an equivalent monotonic native lifecycle precondition checked under the existing mutation lock; terminal close must carry the same contract. BeforeMutationHook exists, but using a package-defined history/CAS policy would reimplement SDK concurrency behavior and needs a shared upstream design. Orchestrator should report upstream; no upstream issue filed here."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["sdk-gap"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-10-27T13:44:23.397Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-27T13:44:23.397Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-ado-sdk-adoption"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"7dc1bd0602e6336161094e1dd2f42f932e3b1767b1dd2b506a70331d3acdee27","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"6327a2195c802127eae16fafdaded04fb4fde16c756c7a9323879d609edc8f32"}
